# Before: literal projection equality existed, but its numeric carrier could fail.
# Now: prove the projection equality and the selected component membership.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_builtin_strategy/literal_tuple_projection_membership.lit
# Boundary: index 0, index beyond length, and wrong component carrier are rejected.
(1, 2)[1] $in C
(1, -2)[2] $in Z
(1, 2)[1] + (3, 4)[1] = 1 + 3
